<title>USA: Salomon hires Mohr for investment banking.</title>
<headline>Salomon hires Mohr for investment banking.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers on Wednesday said it hired Christina Mohr as managing director and co-head of its retail investment banking group.</p>
<p>Mohr comes from Lazard Freres, where she most recently led the retail investing bank group, according to Salomon.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers is a unit of Salomon Inc.</p>
